WEBVTT

1
00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:23.950
"Good morning," Ms. Fender said.

2
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.230
"It's time for the talent show!"

3
00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.590
Dipper spun around in circles.

4
00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.500
Her music filled the air.

5
00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:00.170
Zippy zoomed across the parking lot.

6
00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:02.810
"Watch me!" he said.

7
00:01:09.171 --> 00:01:20.875
Gasser drove over dirt piles.

8
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.860
Poppy told jokes.

9
00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.700
She did balloon tricks.

10
00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:36.267
Jeb looked at Eddy.

11
00:01:36.268 --> 00:01:44.857
"It's our turn now," Jeb said.

12
00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.730
Jeb lifted a big rock.

13
00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:51.330
He tossed it through the air.

14
00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.690
Everyone gasped.

15
00:01:56.028 --> 00:02:00.180
Eddy spun around and—Bang!

16
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.990
The rock landed in Eddy's dumper.

17
00:02:03.802 --> 00:02:06.358
"Got it!" Eddy said.

18
00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:10.967
"Yay!" everyone cheered.

19
00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.570
Jeb tossed another rock.

20
00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:17.350
Eddy moved fast.

21
00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:18.580
Crunch!

22
00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:20.420
He caught the rock.

23
00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.700
The rock landed on the first rock!

24
00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:36.996
Jeb threw more rocks.

25
00:02:36.996 --> 00:02:40.683
Soon Eddy balanced six rocks.

26
00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.840
Everyone cheered.

27
00:02:50.445 --> 00:03:01.080
Eddy and Jeb grinned.
